# Pizza Logs Direct Dependency License Inventory

Author: Neil Mitchell
Last Modified By: Neil Mitchell
Verified: 2026-09-04; Better Auth and font/jQuery notice update: 2026-09-05

Scope: the 42 direct runtime and development dependencies declared in `package.json`, `parser/requirements.txt`, and `parser/requirements-dev.txt`. Versions and license identifiers were read from installed npm packages and the Python 3.14 environment installed from the hash-locked development requirements, then checked against the lockfiles. Better Auth 1.7.2 was added on 2026-09-05 and checked against its installed package metadata, `LICENSE.md` and lockfile entry. Better Call 1.4.0 was promoted from the existing transitive dependency to a direct dependency on 2026-09-05; its installed MIT LICENSE was checked. This is a dependency metadata inventory, not a complete software bill of materials or clearance of project assets.

## Summary

| License | Direct packages |
| --- | ---: |
| MIT | 25 |
| Apache-2.0 | 10 |
| OFL-1.1 | 2 |
| BSD-2-Clause | 1 |
| BSD-3-Clause | 2 |
| ISC | 1 |
| MPL-2.0 | 1 |

`axe-core` is a development dependency with MPL-2.0 metadata. Do not describe this inventory as entirely permissive or infer redistribution compliance from the identifiers alone. Retain each dependency's applicable license and notices when packaging it.

